2026-09-24 19:01:57.399 | INFO     | request_id - 03bd2a7c-740e-4326-b36f-cdace175a0ad | app.agent.nodes.generate_sql:generate_sql:63 - 生成的SQL：SELECT
  t.GMV_2024Q4 AS GMV_2024Q4,
  t.GMV_2025Q4 AS GMV_2025Q4,
  ROUND((t.GMV_2025Q4 - t.GMV_2024Q4) / NULLIF(t.GMV_2024Q4, 0) * 100, 2) AS YoY_Growth_Rate
FROM (
  SELECT
    COALESCE(SUM(CASE WHEN d.date_id BETWEEN 20241001 AND 20241231 THEN f.order_amount ELSE 0 END), 0) AS GMV_2024Q4,
    COALESCE(SUM(CASE WHEN d.date_id BETWEEN 20251001 AND 20251231 THEN f.order_amount ELSE 0 END), 0) AS GMV_2025Q4
  FROM fact_order f
  INNER JOIN dim_date d ON f.date_id = d.date_id
  WHERE d.quarter = 'Q4'
    AND d.date_id BETWEEN 20241001 AND 20251231
